This project is built on nfsu2-ios by myUdav4iik (https://github.com/myUdav4iik/nfsu2-ios), the Apple port of nfsu2-sw by
antoxa2584x (Anton Artemov, https://github.com/antoxa2584x/nfsu2-sw): the static recompilation of the game and its runtime. Their
files keep their authorship. engine/ is their tree with the patches in docs/upstream-patches/ applied, and this project's later
changes are in its git history. Anyone reusing this project's code: keep this credit, and the links to their projects, with it.

docs/upstream-patches/0001-0024 are NFSU2Deadware's by LeoDeadware (https://github.com/LeoDeadware/NFSU2Deadware, MIT,
LICENSES/MIT-NFSU2Deadware.txt), without its HD texture and translation patches; the installer's kit builder, build and import
scripts adapt its tools (MIT). xboxrecomp by sp00nz is MIT (LICENSES/MIT-xboxrecomp.txt); its APU and NV2A parts from xemu are
LGPL-2.1-or-later (LICENSES/LGPL-2.1-xemu.txt, LICENSES/NOTICE-xboxrecomp.txt): the installer ships them as object files and
links them on the player's Mac, so they can be relinked with modified versions. The settings menu follows the design of
SpeedBreaker's by project(u) (GPL-3.0-or-later) and draws with Dear ImGui (MIT, LICENSES/MIT-imgui.txt) in Roboto Medium
(Apache-2.0, LICENSES/Apache-2.0-Roboto.txt). Third-party libraries: THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

No game code or data is part of this project or its releases: the game is built on the player's Mac from their own disc.
